const faq = [
  { q: "What is the fastest car in GTA 6?", a: "By the in-game Speed stat, the Progen Emerus (8.3), then the Pegassi Vitello (8.2) and the Piccia Furia (7.8). Nobody has published tested top speeds yet, so these rankings use the 0–10 Speed bar. The Emerus only shows up reliably through a cheat after the story, which makes the Vitello the fastest car you can realistically find." },
  { q: "Can you buy cars in GTA 6?", a: "Not from a dealer, as far as guides have found. You steal cars and then register the ones you want to keep, either through Moses in Chapter 2 or at Pay 'n' Spray later." },
